{"id":"korabl_","lemma":"корабль","pos":"noun","rank":508,"glosses":["ship, liner","warship","airliner, (large) aircraft (e.g. large passenger airplane, military transport, or bomber)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/2e/Ru-%D0%BA%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%B1%D0%BB%D1%8C.ogg/Ru-%D0%BA%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%B1%D0%BB%D1%8C.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"корабля","plural":"корабли"},"formAudio":{"корабля":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/14/LL-Q7737_%28rus%29-Lvova-%D0%BA%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%B1%D0%BB%D1%8F.wav","корабли":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/69/LL-Q7737_%28rus%29-Lvova-%D0%BA%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%B1%D0%BB%D0%B8.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Где капитан этого корабля?","en":"Where is the captain of this ship?","words":[{"g":"where"},{"g":"captain"},null,null]},{"text":"Это мой корабль.","en":"It's my ship.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"my"},null]},{"text":"Сразу возвращайся на корабль.","en":"Return to the ship at once.","words":[{"g":"at once"},{"g":"to return","l":"возвращаться"},{"g":"on / at"},null]},{"text":"Том — всё ещё капитан вашего корабля?","en":"Is Tom still the captain of your ship?","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},null,null,{"g":"captain"},{"g":"your, yours","l":"ваш"},null],"phrases":[[1,3,"still, yet, as yet"]]},{"text":"Теперь мы должны вернуться на корабль.","en":"We have to return to the ship now.","words":[{"g":"now, at present"},{"g":"we"},null,{"g":"to return"},{"g":"on / at"},null]}]}